    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-δίψιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very thirsty,</i> of ill-watered countries, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄργος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.171
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.570
			</span></i>. (Expld. as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυπόθητος</span>
			 by <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.433e
			</span></i>; Str.also suggests <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυΐψιος</span> (fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴπτω</span>),
				<i>much-destroyed.</i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
